# Demo App Runbook — Full Stack FastAPI Template (Local Dev)

Created: 2026-02-02 07:05 UTC  
Last reviewed: 2026-02-02 07:05 UTC

This runbook is the “ground truth” for starting the vendored demo app from scratch.

## App Location
- `demo/full-stack-fastapi-template/`

## Default local start (Docker Compose)
From the app root:
```sh
cd demo/full-stack-fastapi-template
docker compose watch
```

If you don’t need live file watching:
```sh
cd demo/full-stack-fastapi-template
docker compose up --build
```

