## Default login (development)
From `demo/full-stack-fastapi-template/.env`:
- Email: `admin@example.com`
- Password: `changethis`

To use a different login locally, edit `demo/full-stack-fastapi-template/.env` and restart with a fresh DB:
```sh
cd demo/full-stack-fastapi-template
docker compose down -v
docker compose up --build
```

## Troubleshooting: `docker compose watch` lock path error (Linux)
Symptom:
```text
cannot take exclusive lock for project "...": open /run/user/<uid>/snap.docker/<project>.pid: no such file or directory
```

Fix options:
1) Create the missing runtime dir (common when Docker is installed via Snap):
```sh
# Note: `snap.docker` here is a directory name, not a command to run.
mkdir -p /run/user/$(id -u)/snap.docker
docker compose watch
```

2) If `/run/user/$(id -u)` doesn’t exist (common in WSL/non-systemd shells), set `XDG_RUNTIME_DIR`:
```sh
export XDG_RUNTIME_DIR="$HOME/.xdg-runtime"
mkdir -p "$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR"
docker compose watch
```

3) Fallback without watch:
```sh
docker compose up --build
```

